}}'''Weakenshade''' is a violet-aura offensive spell. It drastically weakens the target or disable their powers. This spell is favored by [[Mr. Wilder]] as his go-to spell.

== History ==
In [[Peru]], Mr. Wilder reluctantly decided to get his hands dirty and used Weakenshade to disrupt [[Zhalia Moon]]'s [[Gar-Ghoul]], allowing [[Hoffman]]'s [[Myrmidon]] to defeat him. {{source|Doorway to Huntik}}

In the [[Tower of Nostradamus]], Wilder tried to hit [[Dante Vale]] with this spell but he dodged in time. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

On [[Avalon]], Wilder used Weakenshade to disable [[Lok Lambert]]'s [[Overslam]] power. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}} 

Wilder used the spell on [[Medusa's Island]] to send [[Kipperin|Powerbonded Kipperin]] back to his [[Amulet]] and send Lok crashing down to the ground. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}

Wilder used this spell in [[the Professor's castle]] in a surprise attack, hitting Lok straight in the back and knocking him unconscious. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}

